> >> Reported-by: Peter Fr=C3=BChberger <fritsch@xbmc.org>
> >> Signed-off-by: Anssi Hannula <anssi.hannula@iki.fi>
> >> Cc: <stable@vger.kernel.org>
> >> ---
> >>=20
> >> Hopefully this fixes HBR (HD passthrough) for the remaining Intel =
users
> >> who were still experiencing problems.
> >=20
