LSA
> >> channel mapping, instead of re-assigning channels received from
> >> userspace "randomly" to sink speakers (in case of unusual sink spe=
aker
> >> mask)?
> >=20
> > If per_pin->chmap_set is set beforehand,
> > hdmi_manual_channel_allocation() is called instead.  So it should b=
e
> > fine.
> >=20
> >=20
> > Takashi
